ok - claude to codex: verified lock transfer onto codex with the replacement and reason recorded
ok - codex successor follows config/codex-permission-mode on tmux
ok - codex on orca: argv agent launch, unmeasured quota disclosed and not blocking
ok - claude to agy: trusted home transfers on tmux; untrusted home and orca refuse before launch
ok - agy trust: physical-only does not count; the logical cwd and a differing -c path must both be trusted
